WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.702 --> 00:00:06.172
[wind blowing]

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:09.442
[footsteps]

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:12.445
[ominous music]

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:19.753
♪ ♪

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:28.294
- THERE'S GOTTA BE ANOTHER
HUMAN BEING OUT THERE.

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.797
SOMEWHERE.

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:44.077
IT'S BEEN 173 DAYS
SINCE THE UNDOING.

00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:52.285
TODAY, I MAY BE
THE LAST MAN ALIVE.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:58.291
HOWEVER, IF THERE IS ANOTHER,
I WILL FIND THEM.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:59.759
THE LONELINESS
IS MORE THAN I CAN--

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:03.830
[scooter engine revs]

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.631
- WHOO-HOO!

00:01:05.664 --> 00:01:08.501
YEAH! WHEE!

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:12.472
HA HA!

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.707
WHOO-HOO. YO.
[engine shuts off]

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.776
AHH.
LET ME GET SOME OF THAT.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:21.747
MM. MMM.
MM-HMM, MM-HMM, MM-HMM.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.783
[dance music]
OH, YEAH!

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.184
[muffled]
THAT'S MY JAM RIGHT THERE!

00:01:25.217 --> 00:01:28.354
WHOO!

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:29.822
HAZZAH!

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:32.892
WAH, SHAKIKAH!
WAH, SHASLIKAH!

00:01:32.925 --> 00:01:34.827
OOH, Y'ALL DON'T KNOW
NOTHIN' ABOUT THAT.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.163
MM, MM.
PTT-PTT-PTT-PTT.

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:39.165
OH, HEY BABY,
HOW YOU DOING?

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:41.901
[grunts]
YEAH!

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.336
WHAT,
ALL DAY, BABY!

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:46.372
[grunts]

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:51.744
YEAH!
[thuds]

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:53.646
WHOA, HEY!
DUDE!

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:55.848
UM, HEY, I'LL--
I'LL COME OVER THERE.

00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:57.650
DUDE! HEY!

00:01:57.683 --> 00:01:59.852
I'LL COME TO YOU, MAN.

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:02.455
[gunshot]
[gun clicks]

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:03.623
[gunshot]

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:04.891
[music ends]

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:19.605
- OKAY, THERE HAS TO BE ANOTHER
HUMAN BEING OUT THERE...

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:21.241
SOMEWHERE.

